[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) of the door check strap (1b) and close the\ndoor again to push the check strap back in.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Rear / rear door coupling left</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235778\">D35</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Rear right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235787\">D36</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the hinge bolts.</p><p>4. Lift the door and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019815.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the door on the hinges.</p><p>Tighten the hinge bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Check the various appliances on the door\nare working properly.</p><p>Make the check strap come out and tighten\nthe bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238636\">7010A14</a></p>"]]